<title>UK: GOLF-ANDERSON CONSULTING WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-ANDERSON CONSULTING WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>DENHAM, England 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the Anderson</p>
<p>Consulting world golf championship on Monday:</p>
<p>Colin Montgomerie (Britain) beat Jose Maria Olazabal (Spain) 2</p>
<p>and 1</p>
<p>Sam Torrance (Britain) beat Ian Woosnam (Britain) 4 and 3</p>
<p>Darren Clarke (Britain) beat Bernhard Langer (Germany) 2 and 1</p>
<p>Costantino Rocca (Italy) beat Jesper Parnevik (Sweden) at 20th</p>
</text>
